  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197478",
      "title": "Coloring the Components & The Overall App",
      "lectureOrder": 54,
      "videoOrder": 51,
      "sourceHash": "55369b50b6982752661cf5e925c3684b7bf137f0066eceee5a8cc2546ff26d87",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.58,
          "en": "So as a next step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.58,
          "end": 6.4,
          "en": "I wanna make sure that we have a nice background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.4,
          "end": 8.62,
          "en": "behind this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.62,
          "end": 11.22,
          "en": "And for a start, I wanna add a nice little color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.22,
          "end": 14.59,
          "en": "in the back, which we will then change to a gradient",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.59,
          "end": 17.48,
          "en": "which we will then change to a background image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.48,
          "end": 19.73,
          "en": "plus a gradient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.73,
          "end": 23.35,
          "en": "But let's start with a single background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.35,
          "end": 25.53,
          "en": "You learned before that there are different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.53,
          "end": 26.39,
          "en": "of setting that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.39,
          "end": 29.26,
          "en": "You can, for example, go to App Json",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.26,
          "end": 31.06,
          "en": "to this configuration file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.06,
          "end": 34.9,
          "en": "and add a backgroundColor property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.9,
          "end": 37.98,
          "en": "and set this to a hex code that will then be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.98,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "as a background color to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 42.683,
          "en": "And this would be a fine way of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.73,
          "end": 45.77,
          "en": "What I will do instead though is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.77,
          "end": 49.16,
          "en": "I will add a background color with help of a view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.16,
          "end": 51.13,
          "en": "And for this I'll go to app.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.13,
          "end": 54.38,
          "en": "because once I add more screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.38,
          "end": 58.93,
          "en": "they will actually still end up in this root app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.93,
          "end": 61.75,
          "en": "So these different screens which I will add later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.75,
          "end": 64.98,
          "en": "will still share this app component as a root.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.98,
          "end": 67.53,
          "en": "So therefore any background color we set here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.53,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "around this View, around this screen, I mean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.77,
          "end": 73.12,
          "en": "will be applied to all screens later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.12,
          "end": 75.163,
          "en": "once we start adding them to app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.02,
          "end": 79.11,
          "en": "Therefore here I will add a View",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.11,
          "end": 82.7,
          "en": "around the StartGameScreen, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.7,
          "end": 84.65,
          "en": "of course for a View to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.65,
          "end": 87.37,
          "en": "we need to import it from react-native though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.37,
          "end": 89.063,
          "en": "otherwise it's not available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.9,
          "end": 93.71000000000001,
          "en": "So now we got this View here around our StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.71000000000001,
          "end": 97.27000000000001,
          "en": "Now we can add some styling to this View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.27000000000001,
          "end": 98.85,
          "en": "And for a start,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 98.85,
          "end": 102.71000000000001,
          "en": "I will add my screen or my rootScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.71000000000001,
          "end": 105.503,
          "en": "whatever you wanna name it, style object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.65,
          "end": 108.15,
          "en": "And I'll set a backgroundColor",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.35,
          "end": 112.1,
          "en": "which should be a nice yellow color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.1,
          "end": 115.31,
          "en": "And I'll pick that yellow color, which I chose here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.31,
          "end": 118.93,
          "en": "for my input element in the StartGameScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.93,
          "end": 120.823,
          "en": "I'll use that same color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.87,
          "end": 126.87,
          "en": "Now we can apply this root screen style to this View here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.91,
          "end": 128.853,
          "en": "by using styles.rootScreen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.3,
          "end": 134.86,
          "en": "Now, if we save this, it only covers this part at the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.86,
          "end": 136.053,
          "en": "And do you know why?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.91,
          "end": 139.22,
          "en": "Because it only takes up the space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.22,
          "end": 142.2,
          "en": "it must take up by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.2,
          "end": 144.11,
          "en": "and that's really important to memorize.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.11,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "Views only take as much space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 151.66,
          "en": "as they need to fit their content into themselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.66,
          "end": 156.43,
          "en": "And the content of this root View is this StartGameScreen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.43,
          "end": 160.16,
          "en": "which in turn is just this input area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.16,
          "end": 161.71,
          "en": "So it's this input box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.71,
          "end": 165.44,
          "en": "plus the margin reserved by this input box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.44,
          "end": 168.68,
          "en": "Now, if I wanna apply this color to the entire screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.68,
          "end": 170.64,
          "en": "what can we do?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.64,
          "end": 174.27,
          "en": "Well, we can use flex: 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.27,
          "end": 178.46,
          "en": "If we add flex: 1 here, this container, this View,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.46,
          "end": 180.15,
          "en": "which receives this style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 180.15,
          "end": 183.74,
          "en": "will take up as much space as available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.74,
          "end": 187.93,
          "en": "So by adding flex: 1 here, now everything is yellow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.93,
          "end": 191.2,
          "en": "So that's how we can add such a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.2,
          "end": 192.17,
          "en": "with a View.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.17,
          "end": 195.44,
          "en": "It's a nice first step, but as a next step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.44,
          "end": 197.713,
          "en": "we will switch to a gradient instead.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
